---
system: sys-01-identity-household-access
flow_id: child-delete
surface: mobile
spec_anchor: /software/systems/01-identity-household-access#child-delete-adr-0011
actors: [ParentApp, Gateway, IdentityService, AccountDeletionService, SQS, PostgreSQL]
apis:
  - PATCH /v1/identity/children/{id}
externals: []
queues: [child.retention]
failure_paths:
  - parent_jwt_stale
  - not_primary_parent
  - child_already_deleted
  - last_active_child_warning
idempotency: PATCH is idempotent on (child_id, status) — repeat with same status is a no-op
retry: single retry on 5xx
timeout: 3s
status: final
---
%% HAND-CURATED. UC-A17 suspend (status=archived) is shared; UC-A18 delete (status=scheduled_for_deletion) is PRIMARY-PARENT-ONLY per ADR-0010 D5 + ADR-0011 D6. Cascade soft-delete to lesson_history/progress/entitlement_grants scoped to child_id. 30-day retention pipeline via sys-14 (AccountDeletionService). children table: active/archived/scheduled_for_deletion/deleted (ADR-0011 NOTE — "suspended" maps to archived).
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant ParentApp
    participant Gateway
    participant IdentityService
    participant AccountDeletionService
    participant SQS
    participant PostgreSQL

    ParentApp->>Gateway: PATCH /v1/identity/children/{child_id} {status: "archived" | "scheduled_for_deletion"} and Bearer JWT
    Gateway->>Gateway: validate parent JWT — extract user_id, household_id, role claim
    alt parent_jwt_stale
        Gateway-->>ParentApp: 401 parent_jwt_stale
    else jwt_valid
        Gateway->>IdentityService: forward request
        IdentityService->>PostgreSQL: SELECT id, status, household_id FROM children WHERE id={child_id}
        PostgreSQL-->>IdentityService: child row or null
        alt child_not_found
            IdentityService-->>Gateway: 404 child_not_found
            Gateway-->>ParentApp: 404
        else child_already_deleted (status = 'deleted')
            IdentityService-->>Gateway: 409 child_already_deleted
            Gateway-->>ParentApp: 409
        else not_household_member
            IdentityService-->>Gateway: 403 not_household_member
            Gateway-->>ParentApp: 403
        else status=archived (suspend — any parent)
            IdentityService->>PostgreSQL: SELECT COUNT(*) FROM children WHERE household_id={household_id} AND status='active'
            PostgreSQL-->>IdentityService: active_count
            alt last_active_child_warning (active_count = 1 and this is the last active)
                Note over IdentityService: Non-blocking warning — still allow suspend
                IdentityService->>PostgreSQL: UPDATE children SET status='archived', updated_at=now() WHERE id={child_id}
                PostgreSQL-->>IdentityService: updated
                IdentityService-->>Gateway: 200 {status: 'archived', warning: 'last_active_child'}
                Gateway-->>ParentApp: 200
            else multiple_active_children
                IdentityService->>PostgreSQL: UPDATE children SET status='archived', updated_at=now() WHERE id={child_id}
                PostgreSQL-->>IdentityService: updated
                IdentityService-->>Gateway: 200 {status: 'archived'}
                Gateway-->>ParentApp: 200
            end
        else status=scheduled_for_deletion (delete — PRIMARY PARENT ONLY per ADR-0010 D5)
            IdentityService->>PostgreSQL: SELECT role FROM household_members WHERE user_id={user_id} AND household_id={household_id}
            PostgreSQL-->>IdentityService: role
            alt not_primary_parent (role != 'owner')
                IdentityService-->>Gateway: 403 not_primary_parent {requires_role: 'owner'}
                Gateway-->>ParentApp: 403
            else primary_parent confirmed
                IdentityService->>PostgreSQL: UPDATE children SET status='scheduled_for_deletion', updated_at=now() WHERE id={child_id}
                PostgreSQL-->>IdentityService: updated
                Note over IdentityService,SQS: Cascade soft-delete per ADR-0011 D6 — scoped to child_id only, other children unaffected
                IdentityService->>PostgreSQL: UPDATE lesson_history SET deleted_at=now() WHERE child_id={child_id}
                PostgreSQL-->>IdentityService: ok
                IdentityService->>PostgreSQL: UPDATE progress SET deleted_at=now() WHERE child_id={child_id}
                PostgreSQL-->>IdentityService: ok
                IdentityService->>PostgreSQL: UPDATE entitlement_grants SET deleted_at=now() WHERE child_id={child_id}
                PostgreSQL-->>IdentityService: ok
                IdentityService-)SQS: enqueue child.retention {child_id, scheduled_deletion_at: now()+30days} → sys-14 pipeline
                SQS-->>IdentityService: queued
                IdentityService-->>Gateway: 200 {status: 'scheduled_for_deletion', deletion_at: now()+30days}
                Gateway-->>ParentApp: 200
                Note over AccountDeletionService: sys-14 retention pipeline executes after 30 days — sets status='deleted'
            end
        end
    end

    Note over ParentApp,PostgreSQL: timeout 3s — PATCH idempotent on (child_id, status) — delete PRIMARY-ONLY (ADR-0010 D5) — 30d retention via sys-14 (ADR-0011 D6) — only target child affected
